# https://github.com/usnistgov/Circuits/blob/master/data/slp/aes/sbox/aes-sbox-fwd-a30-ad4-g205-gd15-xx175-54.circ.txt
# NIST AES circuit index:
# https://github.com/usnistgov/Circuits/blob/master/data/slp/aes/README.md
# originating/reference work:
# https://umizame.github.io/S-box_29-AND/
# NIST transformation/optimization of the 29-AND AES S-box construction by umizame.
# NIST source contains XNOR(input, 0), represented as unary NOT (~) here.
# Unary NOT is an inversion and is not counted in .unrail L/gate/depth statistics.
# Therefore the normalized .unrail counts are one lower than the NIST source totals.
#
# normalized interface: x0..x7 / s0..s7, index 0 = AES byte MSB.
#
# Unrail results:
# NL: total=30, DR=15, DR2SR_B2F=15
# L:  total=174, DR=135, SR_F2B=0, SR_B2F=39
# REG=8
#
# #gates:     204
# depth (NL):  15 (4)
# #L:          174
# #NL:         30
